// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/site/i18n.t27 -- the chrome strings of the t27.ai landing pages, one row per key, a Russian value
; and an English value side by side (gHashTag/trinity issue Trinity-S-AI-DNA/trinity#1918). The page spec
; landing_ru.t27 renders both /ru/ and /en/ from one HUD and takes each of these words by key with
; i18n_get(lang, key). The longer content tables (course, lesson, article, result, about and Queen
; names) stay in the page spec next to the data they label.
; --
; LANGUAGE. By the owner's decision of 2026-11-19 the Russian column carries Cyrillic inside string
; literals only (the same exception as landing_ru.t27). Identifiers, comments and the module line stay
; ASCII English. The English column is the en block of src/lib/motto.ts and src/components/GameHero.tsx
; where those say the words, and plain English elsewhere.
; --
; SHAPE. Three parallel arrays of the same length N_KEYS: KEYS, RU, EN. lang is 0 for Russian, 1 for
; English. A key that is not in the table gives the empty string, and a test pins that every key the
; page asks for is present.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

module site_i18n;

pub const N_KEYS : u32 = 43;
pub const L_RU : u32 = 0;
pub const L_EN : u32 = 1;

